"gc|cleanup"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Uninstalls the specified package (if any) without affecting active packages or dependencies, then removes orphaned packages to free disk space."
,
"zh"
:
"在不影响正在使用的 pkg 或者其依赖的前提下, 卸载pkg(如果在参数中指定), 同时尽力而为地移除未被任何软件包引用的孤立软件包以释放磁盘空间。"
}
,
"--force"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Force execution of the recycling mechanism"
,
